---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const email = 'clement@charterwise.app';
---

<Layout>
  <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <section class="mb-16">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4">
        Operational and AI guidance for charter fleet operators
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed mb-8">
        I help small, independent charter companies find where AI and better process can
        realistically save time, and put it into practice without disrupting how you already run
        things.
      </p>
      <a
        href={`mailto:${email}`}
        class="inline-block rounded-md bg-[var(--color-clay)] text-white px-5 py-2.5 font-medium hover:bg-[var(--color-clay-dark)] transition-colors"
      >
        Get in touch
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-14">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        Who this is for
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg mt-2">
        For small, independent and family run charter fleet operators.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-14">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
        A lot of operators are buried in the day to day: bookings, handovers, admin. There's
        rarely time left for the parts of the business that actually matter. Most sense AI could
        help somewhere, but not exactly where to point it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-14">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-6">What I help with</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-5">
        <li class="border-l-2 border-[var(--color-border)] pl-4">
          <p class="font-medium">A readiness assessment</p>
          <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
            A short, practical look at where your time is actually going, and where AI or better
            process could realistically help.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="border-l-2 border-[var(--color-border)] pl-4">
          <p class="font-medium">Implementation support</p>
          <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
            Hands-on help actually putting a change into practice, not just a report.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="border-l-2 border-[var(--color-border)] pl-4">
          <p class="font-medium">Ongoing advice</p>
          <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
            Light, continuing support once things are running, for as long as it's useful.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] italic mt-6">
        Scoped to what the business actually needs right now, not a full-time commitment.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-14">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">About</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
        I spent over 15 years leading operations teams at Google and Meta. The last several years
        were spent finding where AI could take repetitive, manual work off people's plates, and
        proving it actually saved time rather than just adding another tool to the pile.
      </p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        Charter operators face a smaller version of the same problem: too much time going into
        bookings, handovers, and admin, not enough left for the parts of the business that
        matter. I help figure out where AI and better process can realistically help, and how to
        put that into practice without disrupting how you already run things.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">How a first call works</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        If this sounds useful, the first step is just a conversation, not a pitch. We talk
        through what your day to day actually looks like, and whether there's anything concrete I
        could help with. No cost, no obligation either way.
      </p>
    </section>

    <footer class="pt-10 border-t border-[var(--color-border)] text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
      <p class="mb-2">
        <a href={`mailto:${email}`} class="text-[var(--color-clay)] hover:text-[var(--color-clay-dark)]">
          {email}
        </a>
      </p>
      <p>This is Clement's independent consulting practice, separate from the CharterWise app.</p>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>
